\section{Edge Cases \& Special Characters}

Testing quotes: "double" and \texttt{\textquotesingle{}single\textquotesingle{}} and apostrophes: it's working!

\subsection{Code Escaping}

\begin{Shaded}
\begin{Highlighting}[]
\KeywordTok{def}\NormalTok{ example():}
    \CommentTok{"""Docstring with "quotes" and \textquotesingle{}apostrophes\textquotesingle{}"""}
    \ControlFlowTok{return} \SpecialStringTok{f"Value: }\SpecialCharTok{\{x\}}\SpecialStringTok{ | Special: \textless{}\textgreater{}\&"}
\end{Highlighting}
\end{Shaded}

\begin{Shaded}
\begin{Highlighting}[]
\CommentTok{{-}{-} SQL with operators}
\KeywordTok{SELECT} \OperatorTok{*} \KeywordTok{FROM}\NormalTok{ t }\KeywordTok{WHERE}\NormalTok{ x }\OperatorTok{\textgreater{}} \DecValTok{10} \KeywordTok{AND}\NormalTok{ y }\OperatorTok{\textless{}} \DecValTok{20}\NormalTok{;}
\KeywordTok{SELECT} \StringTok{\textquotesingle{}string with }\CharTok{\textquotesingle{}\textquotesingle{}}\StringTok{quotes}\CharTok{\textquotesingle{}\textquotesingle{}}\StringTok{\textquotesingle{}}\NormalTok{;}
\end{Highlighting}
\end{Shaded}

Inline special chars: \texttt{\textless{}html\textgreater{}}, \texttt{a\ \&\&\ b}, \texttt{x\ \textbar{}\ y}, \texttt{\$PATH}

\subsection{URLs with Parameters}

Link with params: \href{https://example.com/search?q=test\&page=1}{Search Results}

\subsection{Mathematical Expressions}

Comparisons: x \textless{} y, a \textgreater{} b, n \textless= m, p \textgreater= q

Operators: a + b - c * d / e \% f

\subsection{Unicode Support}

International: cafe, naive, resume

Symbols: arrows, checks, stars

Emoji-adjacent: (tm), (c), (r)
